.TH RADAE 1 "2025-01-17" "RADAE 1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
radae \- Real-time Artificial Intelligence Deep learning Audio Encoder
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B radae-trx
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.br
.B radae-tx
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.br
.B radae-rx
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
RADAE is a neural vocoder for HF radio voice communication. It provides high-quality
speech compression using machine learning, optimized for i.MX 8M Plus NPU acceleration.
.PP
.B radae-trx
provides full-duplex operation with simultaneous TX and RX.
.PP
.B radae-tx
provides transmit-only operation.
.PP
.B radae-rx
provides receive-only operation.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-config =\fIFILE\fR
Configuration file (default: /etc/radae/radae.conf)
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-tx\-only
Transmit only mode (for radae-trx)
.TP
.BR \-r ", " \-\-rx\-only
Receive only mode (for radae-trx)
.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-device =\fINAME\fR
Audio device name (overrides config file)
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-verbose
Verbose output
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display help and exit
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Output version information and exit
.SH CONFIGURATION
Configuration files use INI format with the following sections:
.SS [audio]
.TP
.B sample_rate
Audio sample rate (default: 16000)
.TP
.B channels
Number of audio channels (default: 1)
.TP
.B period_size
ALSA period size in frames (default: 160)
.TP
.B buffer_size
ALSA buffer size in frames (default: 1600)
.TP
.B capture_device
ALSA capture device (default: hw:0,0)
.TP
.B playback_device
ALSA playback device (default: hw:0,0)
.SS [ofdm]
.TP
.B sample_rate
OFDM sample rate (default: 8000)
.TP
.B num_carriers
Number of OFDM carriers (default: 30)
.TP
.B symbol_rate
Symbol rate in symbols/second (default: 50)
.TP
.B cp_length
Cyclic prefix length in seconds (default: 0.002)
.TP
.B pilot_spacing
Spacing between pilot carriers (default: 4)
.SS [npu]
.TP
.B enable
Enable NPU acceleration (default: 1)
.TP
.B encoder_model
Path to encoder model (default: /usr/share/radae/radae_encoder_int8.tflite)
.TP
.B decoder_model
Path to decoder model (default: /usr/share/radae/radae_decoder_int8.tflite)
.TP
.B num_threads
Number of CPU threads for inference (default: 2)
.SS [ptt]
.TP
.B enable
Enable PTT control (default: 0)
.TP
.B gpio_chip
GPIO chip name (default: gpiochip0)
.TP
.B gpio_line
GPIO line number (default: 12)
.TP
.B active_low
PTT active low (1) or high (0) (default: 0)
.TP
.B delay_ms
PTT activation delay in milliseconds (default: 100)
.SS [logging]
.TP
.B level
Log level: debug, info, warning, error (default: info)
.TP
.B file
Log file path (default: /var/log/radae/radae.log)
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Full-duplex operation with default configuration:
.B radae-trx
.TP
Transmit only with custom configuration:
.B radae-tx \-c /home/user/myradae.conf
.TP
Receive only with verbose output:
.B radae-rx \-v
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/radae/radae.conf
Default configuration file
.TP
.I /usr/share/radae/radae_encoder_int8.tflite
NPU encoder model
.TP
.I /usr/share/radae/radae_decoder_int8.tflite
NPU decoder model
.TP
.I /var/log/radae/radae.log
Default log file
